      "text_preview": "The learned Standing Counsel would submit that certain restrictions will have to be imposed on the movement of pilgrims from Nilakkal and thereafter from Pamba on 15.01.2024 due to 'Thiruvabharanam' procession."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e1e966b92ab74d34b6a4426ed80b200a_88",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
