        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Having considered the submissions made at the Bar, we SSCR Nos.29, 30 and 36 of 2023 and 3 and 4 of 2024 deem it appropriate to direct the Chief Police Co-ordinator at Sannidhanam to ensure through the Special Officers at Nilakkal and Pamba"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "79c83479021143c1a3bb38329acbc0d1_94",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "14. In the orders passed by this Court in SSCR No.29 of 2023, directions have been issued to ensure that the pilgrims stranded in the queue for considerably long period are provided with medicated drinking water and biscuits."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eb1837d77647492d9da12e39fddc3a84_95",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The directions contained in the aforesaid orders shall be complied with in letter and spirit by all concerned, during Makarajyothi darshan, in order to ensure that the pilgrims have a safe and comfortable darshan."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8393cfb6ec1f4e6991752501c008206d_98",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
